# Buenos Aires Airbnb visitor rules

When adding or replacing an Airbnb URL, follow `src/pages/apartments/buenos-aires-NOTES.md`.

- Flag rules that block bringing **visitors into the unit 24/7**: unit/building bans, overnight visitor bans, after-hours cutoffs, visitor pre-registration.
- Occupancy caps are fine. Do not flag pool/gym-only rules, “no parties,” or booked-renter ID/passport at check-in.
- Only treat “guests” as visitors when the text means external visitors (visitor/visita/invitado/terceros/additional people), not the people staying.
- Scrape BrightData `/house-rules` then the room page; store the **English** wording of the rule in `airbnbGuestRestrictionsByUrl` (translate if the listing is Spanish).
- Put real 404s in `removedAirbnbUrls`.
